  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Tra 901.01 Purpose. The purpose of Tra 900 is to set forth general administrative requirements common to selected aeronautical registrations issued by the bureau and shall apply to registrations of aircraft, aircraft dealers, and commercial aviation operators pursuant to RSA 422:21.\n\nSource. #7997, eff 12-1-03; ss by #10034, ef 11-23-11, EXPIRED: 11-23-21\n\nNew. #13480, eff 11-3-22",
